chess_self_play
================

This repository bundles:

1) Original work (sbatch launchers, eval artifacts, progress reports) under
   `scripts/`, `results/`, `progress_report/`, `README.md`.

2) A vendored chess RL framework under `upstream/vam-chess/`. This subtree
   is a chess-specific recipe layered on top of an upstream RL training
   library and is redistributed under the Apache License 2.0. See
   `upstream/vam-chess/LICENSE` and `upstream/vam-chess/Notice.txt` for the
   underlying notices.

All files outside `upstream/vam-chess/` that do not carry their own
copyright header may be considered released under the Apache License 2.0.
A copy of the license is included at the repository root (`LICENSE`).
